      "body": "## Motivation\n\nAfter padding is disconnected, a genuine token-0 leaf is still discarded when\nonline and external NGRAM results are merged. Corpora proposing 0 and 40 should\npreserve both connected candidates.\n\n## Changes and predecessor\n\nThis PR retains the two original commits from samridh10exe's #43742 unchanged,\nthen adds the focused three-file +29/-4 fix. Padding is identified by a\ndisconnected parent, and the Python debug helper omits disconnected rows.\nRegistered CPU regressions cover both corpus sources and BFS/PROB traversal.\n\nThe predecessor remains unmerged, but its implementation is already included in\nthis branch. Review the incremental delta at\nhttps://github.com/mercury125/sglang/compare/1f2c9017543297a291c88efd9182fa664ea2fb70...581f7e2a787cbce8baedc4345a50c13c4599548a.\nThe branch can be reviewed as a stack; rebase after the predecessor merges.\n\n## Validation\n\nThe tested merge 8055f4fe includes upstream main 51faf523 and the required CI base b6778515. In the\nsource-pinned Torch 2.14.1+cu130 SGLang runtime on RTX 5090, 44 corpus methods and\n14 CUDA sampling/reconstruction tests passed (58 total, including 4 subtests).\nThe GPU run includes six additional local padding-distribution regressions in\neager and CUDA graph modes; those fixtures are validation artifacts rather than\nadditional files in this focused PR. All production kernels are the published\nsource implementation. Full configured pre-commit hooks passed without changing\nthe published files.\n\nReal model serving, broader accuracy/performance evaluation and full upstream CI\nremain unverified. Full upstream CI requires authorization through run-ci.\n\nImplementation and validation were assisted by Codex. The focused commit includes\nattribution and DCO signoff; predecessor authorship and commits are preserved.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38869068172](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38869068172)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38869067966](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38869067966)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38869067976](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38869067976)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
